              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko azana umuryango wa Benyamini uko amazu ya ba sekuruza ari, inzu ya Matirite aba ari yo yerekanwa. Mu nyuma Sawuli mwene Kishi aba ari we yerekanwa. Ariko bamurondeye, ntiyaboneka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
