              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli asigurira abantu ivyo umwami asabwa gukora n’ivyo akorerwa, aca avyandika mu gitabu agishira imbere y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Nuko Samweli arungika abantu, umwe wese ataha iwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.25"
