              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko abantu b’imburakimazi baravuga bati: “Uwu mugabo yodukiza gute?” Baramukengera ntibamuzanira amashikanwa. Ariko Sawuli arinumira.",
